## 📋 SECCIÓN 04: Code Review Rules

### Environment Detection (ALWAYS)

- **Detectar IDE/Terminal**: Cursor, VS Code, etc.
- **Research Capabilities**: Features nativas
- **Leverage Native Tools**: Browser, terminal features

### TypeScript / JavaScript Rules

| Regla | Descripción |
|-------|-------------|
| ✅ `const`, `let` | Siempre |
| ❌ `var` | NUNCA |
| ✅ `interfaces` > `types` | Para objetos |
| ❌ `any` | Estrict typing only |

### React / Frontend Rules

| Regla | Descripción |
|-------|-------------|
| ✅ Functional Components | Exclusivamente |
| ✅ Named Exports | Predictable refactoring |

